[801,22,23],"overrideDocumentation":[],"diagnostics":[],"enclosingRange":[800,12,13],"symbol":"local 150"},{"range":[801,24,35],"overrideDocumentation":[],"diagnostics":[],"enclosingRange":[],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo core https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/library/core str/impl#[str]starts_with()."},{"range":[802,11,12],"overrideDocumentation":[],"diagnostics":[],"enclosingRange":[],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo core https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/library/core ops/bit/impl#[bool][Not]not()."},{"range":[802,12,13],"overrideDocumentation":[],"diagnostics":[],"enclosingRange":[800,12,13],"symbol":"local 150"},{"range":[802,14,25],"overrideDocumentation":[],"diagnostics":[],"enclosingRange":[],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo core https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/library/core str/impl#[str]starts_with()."},{"range":[803,12,30],"overrideDocumentation":[],"diagnostics":[],"enclosingRange":[790,0,796,1],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 validate_shortflag()."},{"range":[803,31,32],"overrideDocumentation":[],"diagnostics":[],"enclosingRange":[800,12,13],"symbol":"local 150"},{"range":[805,8,12],"overrideDocumentation":[],"diagnostics":[],"enclosingRange":[757,0,762,35],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 Keys#"},{"range":[805,14,15],"overrideDocumentation":[],"diagnostics":[],"enclosingRange":[800,12,13],"symbol":"local 150"},{"range":[809,7,27],"overrideDocumentation":[],"diagnostics":[],"enclosingRange":[809,0,45],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 semctx_reindex_probe().","symbolRoles":1}],"symbols":[{"documentation":["An ultra simple CLI arguments parser.\n\nIf you think that this library doesn't support some feature, it's probably intentional.\n\n- No help generation\n- Only flags, options, free arguments and subcommands are supported\n- No combined flags (like `-vvv` or `-abc`)\n- Options can be separated by a space, `=` or nothing. See build features\n- Arguments can be in any order\n- Non UTF-8 arguments are supported\n\n## Build features\n\n- `eq-separator`\n\n  Allows parsing arguments separated by `=`<br/>\n  This feature adds about 1KiB to the resulting binary\n\n- `short-space-opt`\n\n  Makes the space between short keys and their values optional (e.g. `-w10`)<br/>\n  If `eq-separator` is enabled, then it takes precedence and the '=' is not included.<br/>\n  If `eq-separator` is disabled, then `-K=value` gives an error instead of returning `\"=value\"`.<br/>\n  The optional space is only applicable for short keys because `--keyvalue` would be ambiguous\n\n- `combined-flags`\n  Allows combination of flags, e.g. `-abc` instead of `-a -b -c`.<br/>\n  If `short-space-opt` or `eq-separator` are enabled, you must parse flags after values,\n  to prevent ambiguities."],"relationships":[],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 crate/","kind":"Module","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"extern crate pico_args"}},{"documentation":["A list of possible errors."],"relationships":[],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 Error#","kind":"Enum","displayName":"Error","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"pub enum Error"}},{"documentation":["Arguments must be a valid UTF-8 strings."],"relationships":[],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 Error#NonUtf8Argument#","kind":"EnumMember","displayName":"NonUtf8Argument","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"NonUtf8Argument"}},{"documentation":["A missing free-standing argument."],"relationships":[],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 Error#MissingArgument#","kind":"EnumMember","displayName":"MissingArgument","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"MissingArgument"}},{"documentation":["A missing option."],"relationships":[],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 Error#MissingOption#","kind":"EnumMember","displayName":"MissingOption","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"MissingOption(Keys)"}},{"documentation":["A keys container.\n\nShould not be used directly."],"relationships":[],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 Keys#","kind":"Struct","displayName":"Keys","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"pub struct Keys([&'static str; 2])"}},{"documentation":["An option without a value."],"relationships":[],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 Error#OptionWithoutAValue#","kind":"EnumMember","displayName":"OptionWithoutAValue","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"OptionWithoutAValue(&'static str)"}},{"documentation":["Failed to parse a UTF-8 free-standing argument."],"relationships":[],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 Error#Utf8ArgumentParsingFailed#","kind":"EnumMember","displayName":"Utf8ArgumentParsingFailed","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"Utf8ArgumentParsingFailed"}},{"documentation":[],"relationships":[],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 Error#Utf8ArgumentParsingFailed#value.","kind":"Field","displayName":"value","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"pub value: String"}},{"documentation":[],"relationships":[],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 Error#Utf8ArgumentParsingFailed#cause.","kind":"Field","displayName":"cause","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"pub cause: String"}},{"documentation":["Failed to parse a raw free-standing argument."],"relationships":[],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 Error#ArgumentParsingFailed#","kind":"EnumMember","displayName":"ArgumentParsingFailed","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"ArgumentParsingFailed"}},{"documentation":[],"relationships":[],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 Error#ArgumentParsingFailed#cause.","kind":"Field","displayName":"cause","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"pub cause: String"}},{"documentation":["Formats the value using the given formatter.\n\n# Errors\n\nThis function should return [`Err`] if, and only if, the provided [`Formatter`] returns [`Err`].\nString formatting is considered an infallible operation; this function only\nreturns a [`Result`] because writing to the underlying stream might fail and it must\nprovide a way to propagate the fact that an error has occurred back up the stack.\n\n# Examples\n\n```\nuse std::fmt;\n\nstruct Position {\n    longitude: f32,\n    latitude: f32,\n}\n\nimpl fmt::Display for Position {\n    fn fmt(&self, f: &mut fmt::Formatter<'_>) -> fmt::Result {\n        write!(f, \"({}, {})\", self.longitude, self.latitude)\n    }\n}\n\nassert_eq!(\n    \"(1.987, 2.983)\",\n    format!(\"{}\", Position { longitude: 1.987, latitude: 2.983, }),\n);\n```"],"relationships":[],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 impl#[Error][Display]fmt().","kind":"Method","displayName":"fmt","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"fn fmt(&self, f: &mut fmt::Formatter) -> fmt::Result"}},{"documentation":[],"relationships":[],"symbol":"local 0","kind":"SelfParameter","displayName":"self","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"self: &Error"},"enclosingSymbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 impl#[Error][Display]fmt()."},{"documentation":[],"relationships":[],"symbol":"local 1","kind":"Parameter","displayName":"f","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"f: &mut Formatter<'_>"},"enclosingSymbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 impl#[Error][Display]fmt()."},{"documentation":[],"relationships":[],"symbol":"local 2","kind":"Variable","displayName":"key","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"let key: &Keys"},"enclosingSymbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 impl#[Error][Display]fmt()."},{"documentation":[],"relationships":[],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 impl#[Keys]second().",