nships":[],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 Arguments#","kind":"Struct","displayName":"Arguments","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"pub struct Arguments(Vec<OsString, Global>)"}},{"documentation":["Creates a parser from a vector of arguments.\n\nThe executable path **must** be removed.\n\nThis can be used for supporting `--` arguments to forward to another program.\nSee `examples/dash_dash.rs` for an example."],"relationships":[],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 impl#[Arguments]from_vec().","kind":"StaticMethod","displayName":"from_vec","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"pub fn from_vec(args: Vec<OsString>) -> Self"}},{"documentation":[],"relationships":[],"symbol":"local 7","kind":"Parameter","displayName":"args","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"args: Vec<OsString>"},"enclosingSymbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 impl#[Arguments]from_vec()."},{"documentation":["An arguments parser."],"relationships":[],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 impl#[Arguments]","kind":"TypeAlias","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"pub struct Arguments(Vec<OsString, Global>)"}},{"documentation":["Creates a parser from [`env::args_os`].\n\nThe executable path will be removed.\n\n[`env::args_os`]: https://doc.rust-lang.org/stable/std/env/fn.args_os.html"],"relationships":[],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 impl#[Arguments]from_env().","kind":"StaticMethod","displayName":"from_env","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"pub fn from_env() -> Self"}},{"documentation":[],"relationships":[],"symbol":"local 8","kind":"Variable","displayName":"args","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"let mut args: Vec<OsString>"},"enclosingSymbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 impl#[Arguments]from_env()."},{"documentation":["Parses the name of the subcommand, that is, the first positional argument.\n\nReturns `None` when subcommand starts with `-` or when there are no arguments left.\n\n# Errors\n\n- When arguments is not a UTF-8 string."],"relationships":[],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 impl#[Arguments]subcommand().","kind":"Method","displayName":"subcommand","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"pub fn subcommand(&mut self) -> Result<Option<String>, Error>"}},{"documentation":[],"relationships":[],"symbol":"local 9","kind":"SelfParameter","displayName":"self","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"self: &mut Arguments"},"enclosingSymbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 impl#[Arguments]subcommand()."},{"documentation":[],"relationships":[],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 Arguments#0.","kind":"Field","displayName":"0","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"0: Vec<OsString, Global>"}},{"documentation":[],"relationships":[],"symbol":"local 10","kind":"Variable","displayName":"s","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"let s: &str"},"enclosingSymbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 impl#[Arguments]subcommand()."},{"documentation":["Checks that arguments contain a specified flag.\n\nSearches through all arguments, not only the first/next one.\n\nCalling this method \"consumes\" the flag: if a flag is present `n`\ntimes then the first `n` calls to `contains` for that flag will\nreturn `true`, and subsequent calls will return `false`.\n\nWhen the \"combined-flags\" feature is used, repeated letters count\nas repeated flags: `-vvv` is treated the same as `-v -v -v`."],"relationships":[],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 impl#[Arguments]contains().","kind":"Method","displayName":"contains","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"pub fn contains<A>(&mut self, keys: A) -> bool\nwhere\n    A: Into<Keys>,"}},{"documentation":[]