rguments]index_of().","kind":"Method","displayName":"index_of","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"fn index_of(&self, keys: Keys) -> Option<(usize, &'static str)>"}},{"documentation":["Parses a key-value pair using `FromStr` trait.\n\nThis is a shorthand for `value_from_fn(\"--key\", FromStr::from_str)`"],"relationships":[],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 impl#[Arguments]value_from_str().","kind":"Method","displayName":"value_from_str","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"pub fn value_from_str<A, T>(&mut self, keys: A) -> Result<T, Error>\nwhere\n    A: Into<Keys>,\n    T: FromStr,\n    <T as FromStr>::Err: Display,"}},{"documentation":[],"relationships":[],"symbol":"local 17","kind":"TypeParameter","displayName":"A","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"A: Into<Keys>"},"enclosingSymbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 impl#[Arguments]value_from_str()."},{"documentation":[],"relationships":[],"symbol":"local 18","kind":"TypeParameter","displayName":"T","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"T: FromStr"},"enclosingSymbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 impl#[Arguments]value_from_str()."},{"documentation":[],"relationships":[],"symbol":"local 19","kind":"SelfParameter","displayName":"self","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"self: &mut Arguments"},"enclosingSymbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 impl#[Arguments]value_from_str()."},{"documentation":[],"relationships":[],"symbol":"local 20","kind":"Parameter","displayName":"keys","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"keys: A"},"enclosingSymbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 impl#[Arguments]value_from_str()."},{"documentation":["Parses a key-value pair using a specified function.\n\nSearches through all argument, not only the first/next one.\n\nWhen a key-value pair is separated by a space, the algorithm\nwill threat the next argument after the key as a value,\neven if it has a `-/--` prefix.\nSo a key-value pair like `--key --value` is not an error.\n\nMust be used only once for each option.\n\n# Errors\n\n- When option is not present.\n- When key or value is not a UTF-8 string. Use [`value_from_os_str`] instead.\n- When value parsing failed.\n- When key-value pair is separated not by space or `=`.\n\n[`value_from_os_str`]: struct.Arguments.html#method.value_from_os_str"],"relationships":[],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 impl#[Arguments]value_from_fn().","kind":"Method","displayName":"value_from_fn","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"pub fn value_from_fn<A, T, E>(&mut self, keys: A, f: fn(&str) -> Result<T, E>) -> Result<T, Error>\nwhere\n    A: Into<Keys>,\n    E: Display,"}},{"documentation":[],"relationships":[],"symbol":"local 21","kind":"TypeParameter","displayName":"A","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"A: Into<Keys>"},"enclosingSymbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 impl#[Arguments]value_from_fn()."},{"documentation":[],"relationships":[],"symbol":"local 22","kind":"TypeParameter","displayName":"T","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"T"},"enclosingSymbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 impl#[Arguments]value_from_fn()."},{"documentation":[],"relationships":[],"symbol":"local 23","kind":"TypeParameter","displayName":"E","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"E: Display"},"enclosingSymbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 impl#[Arguments]value_from_fn()."},{"documentation":[],"relationships":[],"symbol":"local 24","kind":"SelfParameter","displayName":"self","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"self: &mut Arguments"},"enclosingSymbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 impl#[Arguments]value_from_fn()."},{"documentation":[],"relationships":[],"symbol":"local 25",