,"kind":"SelfParameter","displayName":"self","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"self: &mut Arguments"},"enclosingSymbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 impl#[Arguments]free_from_str()."},{"documentation":["Parses a free-standing argument using a specified function.\n\nParses the first argument from the list of remaining arguments.\nTherefore, it's up to the caller to check if the argument is actually\na free-standing one and not an unused flag/option.\n\nSadly, there is no way to automatically check for flag/option.\n`-`, `--`, `-1`, `-0.5`, `--.txt` - all of this arguments can have different\nmeaning depending on the caller requirements.\n\nMust be used only once for each argument.\n\n# Errors\n\n- When argument is not a UTF-8 string. Use [`free_from_os_str`] instead.\n- When argument parsing failed.\n- When argument is not present.\n\n[`free_from_os_str`]: struct.Arguments.html#method.free_from_os_str"],"relationships":[],"symbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 impl#[Arguments]free_from_fn().","kind":"Method","displayName":"free_from_fn","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"pub fn free_from_fn<T, E>(&mut self, f: fn(&str) -> Result<T, E>) -> Result<T, Error>\nwhere\n    E: Display,"}},{"documentation":[],"relationships":[],"symbol":"local 114","kind":"TypeParameter","displayName":"T","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"T"},"enclosingSymbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 impl#[Arguments]free_from_fn()."},{"documentation":[],"relationships":[],"symbol":"local 115","kind":"TypeParameter","displayName":"E","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"E: Display"},"enclosingSymbol":"rust-analyzer cargo pico-args 0.5.0 impl#[Arguments]free_from_fn()."},{"documentation":[],"relationships":[],"symbol":"local 116","kind":"SelfParameter","displayName":"self","signatureDocumentation":{"occurrences":[],"language":"rust","text":"self: &m